msgid ""
"Available: official examples, shown as published and not audited here. "
"This is not a promise of accessibility. Ask for a macro before using it "
"on a real screen."
msgstr ""
"Disponible: exemples oficials, mostrats tal com es van publicar i sense "
"auditar aquí. No és una promesa d'accessibilitat. Demana una macro abans "
"de fer-lo servir en una pantalla real."

